---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="What we fix – Fettle, London" description="From a wonky fence to a fresh coat of paint, one team does the lot &ndash; and a short bench of vetted specialists covers the trades that need a licence.">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
        <h1>One team, most jobs.</h1>
        <p class="lede">From a wonky fence to a fresh coat of paint, one team does the lot &ndash; and a short bench of vetted specialists covers the trades that need a licence.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-body">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="grid three">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Painting &amp; plastering</h3>
            <p>Fresh coats, patched walls, made-good ceilings. Neat lines, no mess left behind.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Plumbing</h3>
            <p>Dripping taps, running loos, new fittings. A vetted specialist for anything that needs a licence.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Floors &amp; joinery</h3>
            <p>Creaky boards, worn thresholds, shelves that sit straight. Careful work on period detail.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Fences &amp; gardens</h3>
            <p>A wonky fence set right, gates rehung, the outside kept as tidy as the in.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Odd jobs</h3>
            <p>The list on the fridge. Pictures hung, doors eased, the small things that never quite get done.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Seasonal upkeep</h3>
            <p>Gutters, damp-watching, the once-a-season look-over that stops small things becoming big ones.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <div class="prose">
          <h2>Licensed trades, personally vetted</h2>
          <p>For the work that needs a certificate &ndash; plumbing, rendering, tree surgery &ndash; we bring in specialists we know by name and have used before. Same standard, same tidy finish, every job carrying a reputation.</p>
          <div class="badge-row">
            <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>Visit and quote &middot; &pound;90</span>
            <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>Half-day &middot; from &pound;140</span>
            <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>No call-out fee</span>
            <span class="pill"><span class="dot"></span>Tidy finish</span>
          </div>
          <p style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn primary" href="/how-it-works">See how it works</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</Page>
